 and the launch of Radial, my care delivery services company.</p><p>It is an action packed video, please share it with your friends!   Stay tuned tomorrow for another great podcast with my dear friend and co-author in science, Irfan Handoo, M.D.!</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/this-guy-probably-sucks-and-i-havent?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/this-guy-probably-sucks-and-i-havent?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><div id=\"youtube2-tUk2860mlYY\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;tUk2860mlYY&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/tUk2860mlYY?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div>","text":"Greetings friends! The title of this article is a comment left on the video I am about to share, which I found hilarious. I return to the Soft White Underbelly channel! And learn, all over again, that YouTube comments are a dumpster fire.\n\nWe discuss updates in Brain Stimulation science and treatment, the death of a patient and subsequent litigation regarding relentless harassment by her mother, fMRI-EEG biomarker neurofeedback with PRISM, tFUS, TMS, how to advocate for better healthcare coverage, and the launch of Radial, my care delivery services company.\n\nIt is an action packed video, please share it with your friends! Stay tuned tomorrow for another great podcast with my dear friend and co-author in science, Irfan Handoo, M.D.!\n\nSubscribe now\n\nShare"}